<title>USA: Wilkinson County, Miss., yields 5.60 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Wilkinson County, Miss., yields 5.60 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stephens Inc said Wednesday it tentatively priced $31.5 million Wilkinson County, Miss., certificates of participation at a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
